 "status": "accepted",
 "summary": "Window classes, the game's two windows (the batch run's: a RegisterClassW class by atom, style 0, CW_USEDEFAULT; the play run's: 0xCA0000, 320 x 240) and what their procedure sees: WM_GETMINMAXINFO, WM_NCCREATE, WM_NCCALCSIZE, WM_CREATE in order, DefWindowProcW's answers, the cascade and default size, the frame (8 at the sides and bottom, 31 at the top), window longs and extra bytes, the rectangles; LoadIconA by id and IDI_APPLICATION, LoadCursorA(IDC_ARROW). Sprint 063: the game's later calls on its window (batch run 38206263976): SetWindowLongPtrA, the queue (WM_DWMNCRENDERINGCHANGED posted to each new window; PeekMessageA, GetMessageExtraInfo, TranslateMessage, DispatchMessageA; PostMessageW, WM_QUIT), RegisterDeviceNotificationW, GetFocus and SetFocus with the activation's messages, LoadImageW of a cursor file, a missing file and a missing icon.",
 "applicability": "windows-2022 (AMD EPYC 9V74 80-Core Processor); windows-2025 (AMD EPYC 9V74 80-Core Processor)",
